		},
		{
			"id":"320dd1a8d980eab5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"probably at least relevant as they should help people imagine how the game would play overall. also helps explain how i hope to maintain scope control",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":420,
			"y":1420,
			"width":420,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"ee0ac63c49869282",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"testing the resource game loop would be interesting and it's important players get this but the avg playtime will likely be too short to properly show this off\n\nat the same time, the actual mechanics of this permeate even short excerpts of the game esp. in regards to reactivity\n\n-> split into tut (its important players understand that what june does is bad for them, but not every aspect of how it works)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":420,
			"y":1540,
			"width":400,
			"height":300
		},
		{
			"id":"c2a24ef44178cb17",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"visuals should be low prio bc they are my greatest weakness and might even be detrimental if not obviously temporary ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":420,
			"y":1860,
			"width":300,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"a8c1576bf3c3247d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"is USP, so high prio by default",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":420,
			"y":1340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ccbb959de8f25263",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"this is more relevant to MBB to showcase general ability to do them\n\nthen again, they would probably help the drama of the story",
